concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-179sa-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "179SA(3) Charge on property subject to restraining order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-179sa-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The charge:  (a) is subject to every *encumbrance on the property (other than an encumbrance in which the person referred to in paragraph (1)(a) has an *interest) that came into existence before the charge and that would, apart from this subsection, have priority over the charge; and  (b) has priority over all other encumbrances; and  (c) subject to subsection (2), is not affected by any change of ownership of the property." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The charge:  (a) is subject to every *encumbrance on the property (other than an encumbrance in which the person referred to in paragraph (1)(a) has an *interest) that came into existence before the charge and that would, apart from this subsection, have priority over the charge; and  (b) has priority over all other encumbrances; and  (c) subject to subsection (2), is not affected by any change of ownership of the property."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f6b6198a8285a38c1b7fb8557138a1fdeb3499728425aa3a9effb04e0d3acf98" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-179sa ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Charge on property subject to restraining order has priority over other encumbrances." ;
