concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-31 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31 Subsection 266A(2) (after table item 2A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: 2B Authority of a State, or a *self-governing Territory, that has a function under a *corresponding law of the State or Territory Any one or more of the following purposes: (a) engaging in proceedings under that *corresponding law; (b) engaging in proceedings for the forfeiture of things under a law of that State or Territory; (c) deciding whether to institute ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00006  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1  No. 6, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Unexplained Wealth and Other Measures) Act 2015  proceedings of a kind referred to in paragraph (a) or (b) 2C Authority of a foreign country that has one or more of the following functions: (a) investigating or prosecuting offences against a law of the country; (b) identifying, locating, tracing, investigating or confiscating *proceeds or *instruments of crime under a law of the country Assisting in identification, location, tracing, investigation or confiscation of *proceeds or *instruments of crime, if the identification, location, tracing, investigation or confiscation could take place under this Act, or under a *corresponding law of a State or a *self-governing Territory, if the proceeds or instruments related to an offence against a law of the Commonwealth, State or Territory" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: 2B Authority of a State, or a *self-governing Territory, that has a function under a *corresponding law of the State or Territory Any one or more of the following purposes: (a) engaging in proceedings under that *corresponding law; (b) engaging in proceedings for the forfeiture of things under a law of that State or Territory; (c) deciding whether to institute ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00006  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1  No. 6, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Unexplained Wealth and Other Measures) Act 2015  proceedings of a kind referred to in paragraph (a) or (b) 2C Authority of a foreign country that has one or more of the following functions: (a) investigating or prosecuting offences against a law of the country; (b) identifying, locating, tracing, investigating or confiscating *proceeds or *instruments of crime under a law of the country Assisting in identification, location, tracing, investigation or confiscation of *proceeds or *instruments of crime, if the identification, location, tracing, investigation or confiscation could take place under this Act, or under a *corresponding law of a State or a *self-governing Territory, if the proceeds or instruments related to an offence against a law of the Commonwealth, State or Territory"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6542e0fe97cc3f30d40a41655f9673ee21110b7c7374a2c76778e36103aaa6de" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authority to engage in proceedings under corresponding law" ;
